  "content_html": "<div id=\"main\">\n\t\t<section id=\"primary\">\n\t\t\t<div id=\"profile\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cover\" style=\"background-image: url();\"><div class=\"scores\"><span class=\"score-label\">累積人氣<span class=\"score\">1402</span></span><span class=\"score-label\">累積讚數<span class=\"score\">33</span></span><span class=\"score-label\">台客獎章<span class=\"score\">5</span></span></div></div><div class=\"author-info\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/avatars/53/519a459f8498f2109015e5181ea5aa6c-bpfull.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-53-avatar\" width='150' height='150' /><h2 class=\"name-title\">Shawn</h2><h3 class=\"description\"></h3><div class=\"bio\"></div></div>\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<hr>\n\t\t\t<h2>Shawn 發表的文章</h2>\n\t\t\t<div id=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-div divider\">\t\t\t\t\n<article id=\"post-2470\" class=\"post-2470 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-b2g tag-b2g-2 tag-debugging tag-firefox-os\">\n\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2470/%e9%82%84%e5%8e%9f-b2g-crash-%e6%a1%88%e7%99%bc%e7%8f%be%e5%a0%b4\" title=\"Permalink to 還原 b2g crash 案發現場\" rel=\"bookmark\">還原 b2g crash 案發現場</a></h2>\n    <p class=\"entry-posted\">\n      <time datetime=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" title=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" class=\"published\">\n        <a title=\"See all posts from May, 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2013/08\" class=\"posted-month\">8月</a>\n        <span class=\"posted-date\">19</span>\n        <a title=\"See all posts from 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2013\" class=\"posted-year\">2013</a>\n      </time>\n    </p>\n      \t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n      <div class=\"author-meta\" data-author-id=\"53\">\n        <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/shuangmozilla-com\">\n          <img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/avatars/53/519a459f8498f2109015e5181ea5aa6c-bpthumb.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-53-avatar\" width='24' height='24' /><!--\n       --><div class=\"author-info\">Shawn</div><!--\n       --><div class=\"author-title\"></div>\n        </a>\n        </div>\n      </div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\n\t<div class=\"thumb-img\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/crashreporter-512-150x150.png\"/></div>\t<div class=\"entry-content half\">\n\t\t在 Firefox OS 系統中，若 b2g process 發生 crash 時，一般來說是透過 gdb debugger 來除錯，但現實生活中並不是每次系統 crash 都有機會知道複製步驟，能夠將問題重新複製。因此事後針對 gecko crash 分析對於 platform 工程師來說是相當重要的課題。Firefox OS 支援產生 crash dump，本文將介紹將 stack backt.....<a class=\"more\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2470/%e9%82%84%e5%8e%9f-b2g-crash-%e6%a1%88%e7%99%bc%e7%8f%be%e5%a0%b4\">深入了解</a>  \n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\t\n  <footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n            <div class=\"entry-category-box\">\n      文章分類：\n      <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/b2g\" rel=\"category tag\">Firefox OS(B2G)</a>    </div>\n        <div class=\"entry-social-box\">\n      社群分享：\n     <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2470/%e9%82%84%e5%8e%9f-b2g-crash-%e6%a1%88%e7%99%bc%e7%8f%be%e5%a0%b4\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-width=\"40\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-font=\"arial\"></div>     <!-- Place this tag where you want the +1 button to render. -->\n     \n     <div class=\"google-share\"><div class=\"g-plusone\" name=\"gplus\" data-size=\"medium\" data-annotation=\"bubble\" data-width=\"40\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2470/%e9%82%84%e5%8e%9f-b2g-crash-%e6%a1%88%e7%99%bc%e7%8f%be%e5%a0%b4\"></div></div>     \n    <div class=\"pinterest-share\"><a href=\"http://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2470/%e9%82%84%e5%8e%9f-b2g-crash-%e6%a1%88%e